      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Elégance Canine, set up on avenue de Tournamy in Mougins since 2013, offers grooming, nail care and coat care for dogs and cats, with a good local reputation.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon opens from 9am to 7pm Tuesday to Saturday, and from 2pm on Monday. Closed Sunday.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: customers mention a welcoming approach that lets you stay with your dog during grooming — handy if your companion tends to be anxious, but it's best to ask when booking.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
